<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post1130862119993718204..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Living in Amerika </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>13</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4238810095253147364</id><published>2012-09-10T17:44:32.494-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-10T17:44:32.494-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks wiilb for the above Biblical quote.  I, in ...</title><content type='html'>Thanks wiilb for the above Biblical quote.  I, in all honesty, am not much of a Bible reader, but I find that to be one of the best passages I&amp;#39;ve had the pleasure of reading.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/4238810095253147364'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/4238810095253147364'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1347320672494#c4238810095253147364' title=''/><author><name>KPRyan</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1840092578"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 10, 2012 at 5:44 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5518931365953435400</id><published>2012-09-09T09:03:22.777-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-09T09:03:22.777-06:00</updated><title type='text'>@CR106&#xa;&#xa;Those who work against our liberty are the...</title><content type='html'>@CR106&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Those who work against our liberty are the &lt;i&gt;true&lt;/i&gt; slaves of this world:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2 Peter 2:19&lt;br /&gt;While they promise them liberty, they themselves are the servants of corruption:&lt;br /&gt;for of whom a man is overcome, of the same is he brought in bondage.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Keep Mr. Grigg and his family in your prayer.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/5518931365953435400'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/5518931365953435400'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1347203002777#c5518931365953435400' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-119742208"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 9, 2012 at 9:03 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6187211696180797074</id><published>2012-09-09T08:38:25.906-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-09T08:38:25.906-06:00</updated><title type='text'>When  I  lived  in  San Diego Ca. in  the  1980&amp;#3...</title><content type='html'>When  I  lived  in  San Diego Ca. in  the  1980&amp;#39;s, Police chief  Bill Kolander  went  to Israel for  &amp;quot;training&amp;quot;. Over the  rest of the  90&amp;#39;s  many of  our  US police chief went for  &amp;quot;training&amp;quot;.  Welcome to the  NWO. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/6187211696180797074'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/6187211696180797074'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1347201505906#c6187211696180797074' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1545290050"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 9, 2012 at 8:38 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6715378558933325749</id><published>2012-09-07T12:34:18.205-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-07T12:34:18.205-06:00</updated><title type='text'>William, I&amp;#39;ve come to expect quite a lot from ...</title><content type='html'>William, I&amp;#39;ve come to expect quite a lot from you, but you hit it out of the park this time. I also expect there is aleady a drone with your nme on it. I hope you don&amp;#39;t give up the fight any time soon and go underground. Not that it would do any good. Keep them coming. &lt;br /&gt;A fan.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/6715378558933325749'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/6715378558933325749'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1347042858205#c6715378558933325749' title=''/><author><name>Mark P</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/18319472372623119418</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-964518495"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 7, 2012 at 12:34 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4655449088413818635</id><published>2012-09-07T11:58:18.244-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-07T11:58:18.244-06:00</updated><title type='text'>@willb1:  &#xa;&amp;quot;2 Corinthians 3:17&#xa;Now the Lord i...</title><content type='html'>@willb1:  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;2 Corinthians 3:17&lt;br /&gt;Now the Lord is that Spirit: and where the Spirit of the Lord is, there is liberty.&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I needed to hear that.  All this bad news and terrible things portending on the horizon, it&amp;#39;s enough to make me want to slit my wrists.  I don&amp;#39;t fly(TSA).  I don&amp;#39;t talk to anyone about what I read. It&amp;#39;s refreshing to remember that although I&amp;#39;m not free in this country, there is a freedom of spirit that can only be granted by the Spirit of God.  I&amp;#39;m serious!  I&amp;#39;m feeling better already.  Faith comes by hearing and hearing by the word of God.  Thanks.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/4655449088413818635'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/4655449088413818635'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1347040698244#c4655449088413818635' title=''/><author><name>CR106</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16397021653167517464</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-900665621"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 7, 2012 at 11:58 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8030894136433081700</id><published>2012-09-06T23:06:40.352-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-06T23:06:40.352-06:00</updated><title type='text'>And all the sheeple say &amp;quot;*YAWN* What time doe...</title><content type='html'>And all the sheeple say &amp;quot;*YAWN* What time does &lt;i&gt;Dancing With the Stars&lt;/i&gt; come on?&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/8030894136433081700'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/8030894136433081700'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1346994400352#c8030894136433081700' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 6, 2012 at 11:06 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3410632853226744282</id><published>2012-09-06T18:33:24.266-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-06T18:33:24.266-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Militarized cops/the military performing law enfor...</title><content type='html'>Militarized cops/the military performing law enforcement equals the Standing Army the founding fathers feared. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What is really bizarre is that the Third Amendment, long thought to be an anachronism, might even become relevant again!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/3410632853226744282'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/3410632853226744282'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1346978004266#c3410632853226744282' title=''/><author><name>.45jack</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1472129708"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 6, 2012 at 6:33 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8382103314905723681</id><published>2012-09-06T17:59:47.240-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-06T17:59:47.240-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Proof the &amp;#39;War on Drugs&amp;#39; was intended for ...</title><content type='html'>Proof the &amp;#39;War on Drugs&amp;#39; was intended for purposes other than the eradication of illicit drugs in the US?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In Epstein&amp;#39;s &amp;#39;Agency of Fear&amp;#39; there&amp;#39;s this quote: &amp;quot;As long as President Nixon could focus the attention of Congress and the press on the &amp;quot;menace&amp;quot; of heroin addiction destroying America... &amp;quot;  Ah yes, behind Nixon&amp;#39;s executive order creating ODALE was the &amp;#39;scurge&amp;#39; of heroin which the public was told, must be eliminated from the land (or else 10 year olds would soon be shooting up in their school&amp;#39;s restroom) thanks to Nixon&amp;#39;s farsighted thinking.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And what of heroin today?  Many Americans don&amp;#39;t know it yet (the media hasn&amp;#39;t yet been ordered to report it in hyperventilating details) but the US is awash in Afghani white and Mexican brown tar heroin.  It is again extremely inexpensive and it is ubiquitous.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So 40 years after Nixon broke the rules to create this ultra-militarized force advertised to deal a death blow to heroin, heroin is again the drug of choice for the young (and for those who were prescribed opiates by their doctors years ago for pain and then recently informed by the same doctors that the FEDS don&amp;#39;t like Rx opiates and therefore they won&amp;#39;t renew prescriptions... but that&amp;#39;s a somewhat different story).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As the movie stated, It&amp;#39;s a Mad Mad Mad Mad World.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As the movie did not state, the Psychos run it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/8382103314905723681'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/8382103314905723681'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1346975987240#c8382103314905723681' title=''/><author><name>KP Ryan</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-729996957"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 6, 2012 at 5:59 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3737169305225128248</id><published>2012-09-06T09:49:30.751-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-06T09:49:30.751-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Ahh Red Dawn...there is a corn studded turd remake...</title><content type='html'>Ahh Red Dawn...there is a corn studded turd remake of that coming out this fall. It was remade with North Korea (LOL!) instead of China being the invaders. The trojan horse already unloaded, the fifth column is already here. They don&amp;#39;t wear blue helmets they wear suits and practice law. Betcha the judge gets an irs audit notice soon.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/3737169305225128248'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/3737169305225128248'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1346946570751#c3737169305225128248' title=''/><author><name>Jo Stalingrad-Captain USSA Lacrosse</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1770218652"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 6, 2012 at 9:49 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6177532559253993003</id><published>2012-09-06T08:08:46.153-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-06T08:08:46.153-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Wow!  Will, you&amp;#39;ve done it again.  Many of tho...</title><content type='html'>Wow!  Will, you&amp;#39;ve done it again.  Many of those pictures I&amp;#39;ve seen before elsewhere, and so they don&amp;#39;t come as a surprise to me anymore, but they&amp;#39;re depressing none the less.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What really gets my goat is the fact that here we have these idiots in &amp;quot;high places&amp;quot; who, in the midst of their totalitarian delusions, actually show their hand with a straight face no less.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I mean, seriously, who in the hell cares about the UN when the 800 pound gorilla, armed and wearing his full combat gear, has a gun already pointed at your head?!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Does anybody seriously think that the people who have and are being violated daily by the fed and local cops are worried about &amp;quot;blue&amp;quot; hats?  That&amp;#39;s insanely absurd!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/6177532559253993003'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/6177532559253993003'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1346940526153#c6177532559253993003' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-503858410"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 6, 2012 at 8:08 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1149734013651713957</id><published>2012-09-06T07:25:25.220-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-06T07:25:25.220-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;Maybe the word &amp;quot;Christian&amp;quot; means s...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;Maybe the word &amp;quot;Christian&amp;quot; means something else these days?&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We may be deceived but He is not:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hebrews 13:8&lt;br /&gt;Jesus Christ the same yesterday, and to day, and for ever.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;God himself intends us to be free:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2 Corinthians 3:17&lt;br /&gt;Now the Lord is that Spirit: and where the Spirit of the Lord is, there is liberty.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As Grigg continues to document in his writings, the signs are full, but as hard&lt;br /&gt;as they try they will &lt;i&gt;never&lt;/i&gt; win.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Luke 21:28&lt;br /&gt;And when these things begin to come to pass, then look up, and lift up your heads; for your redemption draweth nigh.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The tragedy in all of this is that no matter how many times they fail, &lt;br /&gt;the keep trying to lock us up.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Their&lt;/b&gt; resistance is futile.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/1149734013651713957'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/1149734013651713957'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html?showComment=1346937925220#c1149734013651713957' title=''/><author><name>willb1@pmask.com</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/09/living-in-amerika.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1130862119993718204' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1130862119993718204' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1769582171"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 6, 2012 at 7:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6516528061268411759</id><published>2012-09-05T23:46:03.042-06:00</published><updated>2012-09-05T23:46:03.042-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Wife says: &amp;quot;More!? You&amp;#39;re reading article...</title><content type='html'>Wife says: &amp;quot;More!? You&amp;#39;re reading articles that say the same thing,... over and over.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;My response:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;It&amp;#39;s better to know all about the bastards than to be clueless.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Then I thought, Shhi... we&amp;#39;re surrounded by a vampire People who love death and destruction more than their own families and children.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What&amp;#39;s wrong with these People?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Can&amp;#39;t they see?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And wait,... aren&amp;#39;t most of them &amp;quot;Christians&amp;quot;?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;... Maybe the word &amp;quot;Christian&amp;quot; means something else these days? I don&amp;#39;t know. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Same as it ever was?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I DO know this: Will Grigg is heroic for pointing this cr... sh... stuff out in a civilized way. [I feel bad about not sending him my entire treasure to support opening eyes,... but I think every eye that can be opened has been opened. ... I pray I&amp;#39;m wrong.]&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There is so little civilization these days... I don&amp;#39;t know how those bully-thug bastards can look at themselves in the mirror everyday. ... But then, I&amp;#39;m not a sociopath like they are, so there&amp;#39;s no way I could ever understand.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I think I&amp;#39;m going to approach life as if I were living on Mars, because that&amp;#39;s exactly how it seems these days - nothing is real - just about Everything(!) is fake and a lie... that&amp;#39;s what America is all about. ... A nation of posuers,... a howwlowed shell of itself,... the old fable called &amp;quot;America&amp;quot; is no longer,... if it ever was.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;Not that all that means anything to anyone&amp;quot; - said the tiny speck of dust to the whorlwind.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- clark</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/6516528061268411759'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1130862119993718204/comments/default/6516528061268411759'/><link r